1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,307
@SpaceStationScene
{Music:Play|name=space_ambient|fadeIn=2.0|baseVolume=0.3|endTime=30.0}
{Position:Zorak|x=-1.2|y=0.01|z=0.5|face=right}
{Position:Klaw|x=1.8|y=0.01|z=-0.3|face=left}
{Position:Vex|x=0.3|y=0.01|z=1.5|face=back}
{Zorak}{FaceDetermined}
{Zorak}{FaceBlink}
[Zorak] 信号确认。坐标X-7749，未知星系边缘。
{Camera:Static|position=0,1.8,5|lookAt=0,1.0,0}

2
00:00:06,606 --> 00:00:09,606
[Klaw] 扫描显示...有生命反应。
{Klaw}{FaceSurprised}
{Klaw}{FaceBlink}
{Camera:TwoShot|position=0,1.6,4|lookAt=0,1.0,0}

3
00:00:09,907 --> 00:00:12,907
[Vex] 能量读数很奇怪。不像任何已知文明。
{Vex}{FaceConfused}
{Vex}{FaceBlink}
{Camera:Static|position=2,1.5,3|lookAt=0,1.0,0}

4
00:00:13,208 --> 00:00:16,207
[Zorak] 准备登陆。我们是探险队，不是征服者。
{Zorak}{PointForward}
{Zorak}{FaceDetermined}
{Camera:CloseUp|target=Zorak|distance=2.5|height=1.6}

5
00:00:16,506 --> 00:00:19,007
[Klaw] 如果那些家伙不友好呢？
{Klaw}{CrossArms}
{Klaw}{FaceBlink}
{Camera:ReactionShot|target=Klaw|distance=3|height=1.5}

6
00:00:19,307 --> 00:00:21,807
[Vex] 那我们就跑。我的翅膀可不是摆设。
{Vex}{Shrug}
{Vex}{FaceSmirk}
{Vex}{FaceBlink}
{Camera:Static|position=-2,1.5,3|lookAt=0,1.0,0}

7
00:00:22,108 --> 00:00:25,807
{Zorak}{Walk}
{Klaw}{Walk}
{Vex}{Walk}
{Event:Move|character=Zorak|x=-8|z=0|duration=3.0}
{Event:Move|character=Klaw|x=8|z=0|duration=3.0}
{Event:Move|character=Vex|x=0|z=-5|duration=3.0}
{Transition:Fade|duration=1.0}
{Camera:Pan|from=-5,2,8|to=5,2,8|duration=3.0}

8
00:00:26,108 --> 00:00:29,108
@AlienPlanetScene
{Music:Play|name=alien_world|fadeIn=1.5|baseVolume=0.25|endTime=90.0}
{Position:Zorak|x=-1.8|y=0.01|z=0.8|face=right}
{Position:Klaw|x=2.2|y=0.01|z=-0.5|face=left}
{Position:Vex|x=0.5|y=0.01|z=1.8|face=back}
{Zorak} 空气可呼吸。重力0.92标准值。
{Zorak}{FaceBlink}
{Camera:Static|position=0,1.8,6|lookAt=0,1.0,0}

9
00:00:29,408 --> 00:00:32,408
[Klaw] 这些植物...在发光？
{Klaw}{LookAround}
{Klaw}{FaceSurprised}
{Klaw}{FaceBlink}
{Camera:LowAngle|target=Klaw|distance=4|height=0.5}

10
00:00:32,707 --> 00:00:35,707
[Vex] 生物荧光。和泽拉克深海生物类似。
{Vex}{HandsOnHips}
{Vex}{FaceBlink}
{Camera:Static|position=-3,1.5,4|lookAt=0,1.0,0}

11
00:00:36,008 --> 00:00:39,008
[Zorak] 等等。有动静。
{Zorak}{FightingStance}
{Zorak}{FaceDetermined}
{Zorak}{FaceBlink}
{Camera:FightDramatic|target=Zorak|distance=4|height=1.2}

12
00:00:39,307 --> 00:00:42,307
{Event:Move|character=Zorak|x=-1|z=0|duration=0.8}
{Zorak}{Run}
{Event:Move|character=Klaw|x=1|z=0|duration=0.8}
{Klaw}{Run}
{Event:Move|character=Vex|x=0|z=-1|duration=0.8}
{Vex}{Run}
{SFX:Play|name=dash_whoosh}
{Camera:FightWide|distance=6|height=2}

13
00:00:42,606 --> 00:00:45,606
[Zorak] 从岩石后面出来！我们知道你在那儿！
{Zorak}{PointForward}
{Zorak}{FaceAngry}
{Zorak}{FaceBlink}
{Camera:Static|position=0,1.6,5|lookAt=0,1.0,0}

14
00:00:45,908 --> 00:00:49,408
[Rex] ...你们是谁？
{Position:Rex|x=0|y=0.01|z=-4|face=forward}
{Rex}{CrossArms}
{Rex}{FaceSmirk}
{Rex}{FaceBlink}
{Camera:FightDramaticReveal|target=Rex|distance=5|height=1.0}

15
00:00:49,707 --> 00:00:52,707
[Klaw] 是晶体生物！这里居然有晶体生物！
{Klaw}{SurprisedJump}
{Klaw}{FaceSurprised}
{Klaw}{FaceBlink}
{Camera:ReactionShot|target=Klaw|distance=3|height=1.5}

16
00:00:53,008 --> 00:00:56,508
[Rex] 我叫Rex。你们这些外星人，来我的星球干嘛？
{Rex}{HandsOnHips}
{Rex}{FaceBlink}
{Camera:Static|position=3,1.6,4|lookAt=0,1.0,0}

17
00:00:56,807 --> 00:00:59,807
[Zorak] 我们是星际探险队。我叫泽拉克，这是克劳和维克斯。
{Zorak}{Bow}
{Zorak}{FaceBlink}
{Camera:TwoShot|position=0,1.6,4|lookAt=0,1.0,0}

18
00:01:00,106 --> 00:01:06,567
[Vex] 我们没有敌意。只是在探索未知星系。
{Vex}{WaveHand}
{Vex}{FaceHappy}
{Vex}{FaceBlink}
{Camera:Static|position=-2,1.5,4|lookAt=0,1.0,0}

19
00:01:06,867 --> 00:01:10,367
[Rex] 探索？哼。你们最好小心点。这颗星球可不止有植物。
{Rex}{FaceSmirk}
{Rex}{FaceBlink}
{Camera:CloseUp|target=Rex|distance=2.5|height=1.5}
{Rex}{FaceReset}

20
00:01:10,667 --> 00:01:13,707
[Klaw] 什么意思？有什么危险的？
{Klaw}{ScratchHead}
{Klaw}{FaceConfused}
{Klaw}{FaceBlink}
{Camera:Static|position=2,1.5,4|lookAt=0,1.0,0}

21
00:01:14,007 --> 00:01:17,507
[Rex] 意思是...最危险的，是看起来最普通的。
{Rex}{PointForward}
{Rex}{FaceDetermined}
{Rex}{FaceBlink}
{Camera:FightDramatic|target=Rex|distance=4|height=1.2}

22
00:01:17,808 --> 00:01:20,808
{Zorak}{FightingStance}
{Klaw}{FightingStance}
{Vex}{FightingStance}
[Zorak] 你在威胁我们？
{Zorak}{FaceAngry}
{Zorak}{FaceBlink}
{Camera:FightWide|distance=7|height=2}

23
00:01:21,108 --> 00:01:24,108
[Rex] 不。我在警告你们。
{Rex}{FightingStance}
{Rex}{FaceDetermined}
{Rex}{FaceBlink}
{SFX:Play|name=energy_charge}
{FXPlasmaBolt|character=Rex}
{FXCrystalShards|character=Rex}
{Camera:FightDramatic|target=Rex|distance=3|height=1.0}

24
00:01:24,406 --> 00:01:27,406
[Vex] 他的能量读数...在飙升！
{Vex}{FaceSurprised}
{Vex}{FaceBlink}
{FXBioluminescentPulse|character=Vex}
{Camera:ReactionShot|target=Vex|distance=2.5|height=1.4}
{Vex}{FaceReset}

25
00:01:27,707 --> 00:01:30,707
[Zorak] 等等！我们没有要战斗的意思！
{Zorak}{FaceDetermined}
{Zorak}{FaceBlink}
{Zorak}{HandsUp}
{Camera:Static|position=0,1.6,5|lookAt=0,1.0,0}

26
00:01:31,007 --> 00:01:34,007
[Rex] ...那就证明给我看。
{Rex}{DashForward}
{Rex}{FaceBlink}
{SFX:Play|name=dash_whoosh}
{Camera:FightFollow|target=Rex|distance=4|height=1.2}

27
00:01:34,308 --> 00:01:36,808
{Zorak}{Dodge}
{Zorak}{FaceBlink}
{SFX:Play|name=whoosh_fast}
{Camera:FightImpact|distance=3|height=1.0}

28
00:01:37,108 --> 00:01:39,608
[Rex] 反应不错，紫晶。
{Rex}{LeftPunch}
{Rex}{FaceSmirk}
{Rex}{FaceBlink}
{SFX:Play|name=punch_light}
{Camera:FightSide|distance=4|height=1.2}

29
00:01:39,906 --> 00:01:42,406
{Zorak}{Block}
{Zorak}{FaceDetermined}
{Zorak}{FaceBlink}
{SFX:Play|name=block_guard}
{Camera:FightImpact|distance=2.5|height=1.0}

30
00:01:42,707 --> 00:01:45,207
[Klaw] 嘿！二打一不公平！
{Klaw}{Run}
{Klaw}{FaceAngry}
{Klaw}{FaceBlink}
{SFX:Play|name=dash_whoosh}
{Camera:FightWide|distance=6|height=2}

31
00:01:45,507 --> 00:01:48,007
{Klaw}{LeftPunch}
{Rex}{Dodge}
{Rex}{FaceBlink}
{SFX:Play|name=whoosh_fast}
{Camera:FightFollow|target=Rex|distance=4|height=1.2}

32
00:01:48,308 --> 00:01:53,963
[Rex] 哈！鳞甲也来凑热闹？
{Rex}{RightPunch}
{Rex}{FaceHappy}
{Rex}{FaceBlink}
{SFX:Play|name=punch_hit}
{Camera:FightImpact|distance=2.5|height=1.0}

33
00:01:54,263 --> 00:01:56,763
{Klaw}{HitStagger}
{Klaw}{FacePain}
{Klaw}{FaceBlink}
{SFX:Play|name=impact_thud}
{Camera:ReactionShot|target=Klaw|distance=3|height=1.5}

34
00:01:57,063 --> 00:02:00,063
[Vex] 够了！我们不是来打架的！
{Vex}{DashForward}
{Vex}{FaceAngry}
{Vex}{FaceBlink}
{SFX:Play|name=dash_whoosh}
{Camera:Static|position=0,1.6,6|lookAt=0,1.0,0}

35
00:02:00,362 --> 00:02:02,862
{Vex}{Block}
{Rex}{Kick}
{Rex}{FaceBlink}
{SFX:Play|name=kick_impact}
{Vex}{HitStagger}
{Vex}{FacePain}
{Camera:FightImpact|distance=2.5|height=1.0}

36
00:02:03,164 --> 00:02:06,164
[Rex] 三个人一起上？有意思。
{Rex}{FightingStance}
{Rex}{FaceSmirk}
{Rex}{FaceBlink}
{SFX:Play|name=energy_charge}
{Camera:FightDramatic|target=Rex|distance=3|height=1.0}

37
00:02:06,463 --> 00:02:09,463
{Zorak}{FightingStance}
{Klaw}{FightingStance}
{Vex}{FightingStance}
[Zorak] 停手！我们真的不想战斗！
{Zorak}{FaceDetermined}
{Zorak}{FaceBlink}
{Camera:FightWide|distance=8|height=2.5}

38
00:02:09,764 --> 00:02:12,764
{Zorak}{Walk}
{Event:Move|character=Zorak|x=0|z=0|duration=1.5}
[Zorak] 看，我放下手。我们是和平的。
{Zorak}{CrossArms}
{Zorak}{FaceBlink}
{Camera:Static|position=0,1.6,5|lookAt=0,1.0,0}

39
00:02:13,063 --> 00:02:16,064
[Rex] ...哼。
{Rex}{FaceSmirk}
{Rex}{CrossArms}
{Rex}{FaceBlink}
{SFX:Play|name=wind_gentle}
{Camera:CloseUp|target=Rex|distance=2.5|height=1.5}

40
00:02:16,362 --> 00:02:19,362
[Rex] 你们三个...挺有意思的。好吧，我暂时相信你们。
{Rex}{Nod}
{Rex}{FaceBlink}
{Camera:TwoShot|position=0,1.6,5|lookAt=0,1.0,0}

41
00:02:19,664 --> 00:02:22,664
[Klaw] 所以...不打了吗？
{Klaw}{ScratchHead}
{Klaw}{FaceConfused}
{Klaw}{FaceBlink}
{Camera:ReactionShot|target=Klaw|distance=3|height=1.4}

42
00:02:22,963 --> 00:02:25,963
[Rex] 暂时。但如果你们敢伤害这颗星球...
{Rex}{PointForward}
{Rex}{FaceDetermined}
{Rex}{FaceBlink}
{Camera:CloseUp|target=Rex|distance=2.5|height=1.5}

43
00:02:26,264 --> 00:02:29,264
[Vex] 我们发誓！我们只是探险家！
{Vex}{WaveHand}
{Vex}{FaceHappy}
{Vex}{FaceBlink}
{Camera:Static|position=-2,1.5,5|lookAt=0,1.0,0}

44
00:02:29,564 --> 00:02:40,382
[Zorak] 也许...我们可以互相帮助。你熟悉这里，我们有飞船和技术。
{Zorak}{ReachOut}
{Zorak}{FaceBlink}
{Camera:TwoShot|position=0,1.6,5|lookAt=0,1.0,0}

45
00:02:40,680 --> 00:02:43,680
[Rex] 互相帮助？
{Rex}{Think}
{Rex}{FaceConfused}
{Rex}{FaceBlink}
{Camera:Static|position=3,1.6,4|lookAt=0,1.0,0}

46
00:02:43,981 --> 00:02:46,981
[Rex] ...好吧。但有一个条件。
{Rex}{HandsOnHips}
{Rex}{FaceSmirk}
{Rex}{FaceBlink}
{Camera:CloseUp|target=Rex|distance=2.5|height=1.5}

47
00:02:47,281 --> 00:02:50,281
[Zorak] 什么条件？
{Zorak}{Nod}
{Zorak}{FaceBlink}
{Camera:Static|position=0,1.6,5|lookAt=0,1.0,0}

48
00:02:50,580 --> 00:02:53,580
[Rex] 教我开你们的飞船。
{Rex}{FaceSmirk}
{Rex}{FaceBlink}
{SFX:Play|name=wind_gentle}
{Camera:FightDramatic|target=Rex|distance=3|height=1.0}

49
00:02:53,882 --> 00:02:56,882
[Klaw] 什么？！让晶体生物开飞船？
{Klaw}{FaceSurprised}
{Klaw}{SurprisedJump}
{Klaw}{FaceBlink}
{Camera:ReactionShot|target=Klaw|distance=3|height=1.4}
{Klaw}{FaceReset}

50
00:02:57,180 --> 00:03:00,180
[Vex] 我觉得...挺有趣的。
{Vex}{FaceHappy}
{Vex}{FaceBlink}
{Camera:Static|position=-2,1.5,4|lookAt=0,1.0,0}
{Vex}{FaceReset}

51
00:03:00,481 --> 00:03:03,481
[Zorak] ...成交。欢迎来到星际探险队，Rex。
{Zorak}{ReachOut}
{Zorak}{FaceHappy}
{Zorak}{FaceBlink}
{Camera:TwoShot|position=0,1.6,5|lookAt=0,1.0,0}

52
00:03:03,781 --> 00:03:06,781
[Rex] 叫我Rex就行。星际探险队...听起来挺酷的。
{Rex}{WaveHand}
{Rex}{FaceHappy}
{Rex}{FaceBlink}
{Camera:Static|position=0,1.6,6|lookAt=0,1.0,0}
{Rex}{FaceReset}

53
00:03:07,080 --> 00:03:10,080
{Zorak}{Walk}
{Klaw}{Walk}
{Vex}{Walk}
{Rex}{Walk}
{Event:Move|character=Zorak|x=-3|z=2|duration=2.5}
{Event:Move|character=Klaw|x=3|z=2|duration=2.5}
{Event:Move|character=Vex|x=0|z=3|duration=2.5}
{Event:Move|character=Rex|x=0|z=1|duration=2.5}
{Transition:Fade|duration=2.0}
{Camera:Pan|from=-5,2,8|to=5,2,8|duration=3.0}

54
00:03:10,382 --> 00:03:13,382
[Zorak] 那么，Rex。带我们去看看你的星球吧。
{Zorak}{PointForward}
{Zorak}{FaceBlink}
{Camera:Static|position=0,2,8|lookAt=0,1.0,0}

55
00:03:13,680 --> 00:03:16,680
[Rex] 跟紧了，外星人们。旅程才刚刚开始。
{Rex}{Run}
{Rex}{FaceHappy}
{Rex}{FaceBlink}
{SFX:Play|name=dash_whoosh}
{Camera:FightFollow|target=Rex|distance=5|height=1.5}

56
00:03:16,981 --> 00:03:19,981
{Zorak}{Run}
{Klaw}{Run}
{Vex}{Run}
{Zorak}{FaceBlink}
{Klaw}{FaceBlink}
{Vex}{FaceBlink}
{SFX:Play|name=dash_whoosh}
{Music:Play|name=space_ambient|fadeIn=1.0|baseVolume=0.2|endTime=45.0}
